      "credit_limit": "$14,000 to $75,000",
      "eligibility": "Minimum personal FICO score of 690; established businesses are evaluated using PAYDEX of 42",
      "important_note": "Its maximum documented credit limit is below the $100,000 purchase amount, and Apple Music is not confirmed to qualify as a sustainable merchant."
